h there exist \\(n\\) distinct lines satisfying the two conditions of the\nproblem is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\begin{cases}\n\\{0,1,2,\\dots ,n\\}, & n\\ \\text{odd},\\\\[2mm]\n\\{0,1,2,\\dots ,n-1\\}, & n\\ \\text{even}.\n\\end{cases}}\n\\]"
